<section class="landing-about" id="cara-kerja"><div><div class="eyebrow">Dibuat untuk keseharian petani</div><h2>Lebih teratur mengelola lahan,<br/>lebih mudah menemukan bantuan.</h2></div><p>Catat kegiatan yang penting, dapatkan pengingat, dan bawa pertanyaanmu ke penyuluh. Semua informasi budidaya tersimpan rapi dan mudah dibuka kapan saja.</p></section><div class="landing-footer" id="tentang"><span>© 2026 Temu Penyuluh</span><span>Teman Digital Petani, dari Tanam hingga Panen.</span><button onclick={()=>setDemo('Petani')}>Lihat demo aplikasi <ArrowUpRight size={13}/></button></div></main></div>
{:else}
<div class="app-shell"><aside class:mobile-open={menuOpen} class="sidebar"><a class="brand" href="/" onclick={(e)=>e.preventDefault()}><span class="brand-icon"><Sprout size={21}/></span><span>temu penyuluh<small>Teman digital petani</small></span><button class="close-mobile" onclick={()=>menuOpen=false}><X size={18}/></button></a><div class="nav-label">MENU UTAMA</div><nav class="side-nav">{#each role==='Penyuluh'?officerNav:role==='Admin'?adminNav:nav as item}<button class:active={current===item.name} onclick={()=>go(item.name)}><svelte:component this={item.icon} size={18} strokeWidth={1.8}/><span>{item.name}</span>{#if item.name==='Temu Penyuluh'}<i class="nav-count">2</i>{/if}</button>{/each}</nav><div class="nav-label nav-secondary">AKUN</div><nav class="side-nav"><button class:active={current==='Notifikasi'} onclick={()=>go('Notifikasi')}><Bell size={18}/><span>Notifikasi</span><i class="unread-dot"></i></button><button class:active={current==='Profil Saya'} onclick={()=>go('Profil Saya')}><UserRound size={18}/><span>Profil saya</span></button></nav><div class="sidebar-spacer"></div><div class="help-card"><div class="help-leaf"><Sprout size={16}/></div><b>Ada yang ingin ditanyakan?</b><p>Penyuluh kami siap membantu kondisi lahanmu.</p><button onclick={()=>{modal='consult'}}>Hubungi penyuluh <ArrowUpRight size={14}/></button></div><button class="profile-mini" onclick={()=>go('Profil Saya')}><span class="avatar">{profile.name.split(' ').map(x=>x[0]).slice(0,2).join('')}</span><span class="profile-mini-text"><b>{profile.name}</b><small>{role} · {profile.location.split(',')[0]}</small></span><MoreHorizontal size={18}/></button></aside>
<main class="main-shell"><header class="topbar"><div class="topbar-left"><button class="mobile-menu dark" onclick={()=>menuOpen=true}><Menu size={20}/></button><div class="breadcrumb">Temu Penyuluh <ChevronRight size={14}/><b>{pageTitle}</b></div></div><div class="topbar-right"><label class="search-box"><Search size={16}/><input placeholder="Cari lahan, artikel..." bind:value={searchText}/><kbd>⌘ K</kbd></label><button class="top-icon" title="Notifikasi" onclick={()=>go('Notifikasi')}><Bell size={19}/><i></i></button><span class="top-separator"></span><button class="role-switch" onclick={()=>modal='role'}><span class="avatar tiny">{profile.name.split(' ').map(x=>x[0]).slice(0,2).join('')}</span><span>{role}</span><ChevronDown size={14}/></button></div></header>
<div class="page-content">
{#if current==='Beranda'}
<div class="page-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">MINGGU, 27 SEPTEMBER 2026</div><h1>Selamat pagi, {profile.name.split(' ')[0]} <span>🌱</span></h1><p>Ini kabar terbaru dari lahanmu hari ini.</p></div><div class="location-pill"><MapPin size={15}/>{profile.location}</div></div>
<section class="welcome-banner"><div class="banner-copy"><span class="season-tag">MUSIM TANAM · HARI KE-26</span><h2>Tanaman tumbuh baik,<br/>terus semangat, Pak Budi.</h2><p>Jagung manis di Kebun Utama sedang dalam fase vegetatif. Pastikan kebutuhan airnya tercukupi.</p><div class="banner-actions"><button class="btn btn-lime" onclick={()=>{selectedField=fields[0];go('Lahan Saya')}}>Lihat perkembangan <ChevronRight size={15}/></button><button class="btn btn-glass" onclick={()=>modal='consult'}>Tanya penyuluh</button></div></div><div class="banner-image"></div><div class="banner-harvest"><span>🌽</span><div><small>PERKIRAAN PANEN</small><b>25 Nov 2026</b></div><ArrowUpRight size={16}/></div></section>
<div class="stats-grid"><article class="weather-card"><div class="weather-top"><div><b>Cuaca hari ini</b><small><MapPin size={12}/> Cibinong, Bogor</small></div><CloudSun size={29} class="weather-icon"/></div><div class="weather-bottom"><strong>28°</strong><span>Cerah berawan<small>Terasa seperti 31°</small></span><div class="weather-detail"><span><Droplets size={13}/> Kelembapan</span><b>76%</b></div><div class="weather-detail"><span>☂ Peluang hujan</span><b>20%</b></div></div></article><article class="stat-card"><div class="stat-top"><span>Kondisi lahan</span><i>🌿</i></div><b>Baik</b><small class="stat-positive"><Activity size={12}/> Stabil minggu ini</small></article><article class="stat-card"><div class="stat-top"><span>Jadwal hari ini</span><i>🗓️</i></div><b>{todayActivities.length||2} <small>kegiatan</small></b><small class="stat-positive"><Check size={12}/> Teratur dijadwalkan</small></article><article class="stat-card"><div class="stat-top"><span>Umur tanaman</span><i>🌽</i></div><b>26 <small>hari</small></b><small class="stat-positive"><Leaf size={12}/> Fase vegetatif</small></article></div>
<div class="dashboard-grid"><article class="panel field-panel"><div class="panel-head"><div><h2>Lahan saya</h2><p>Pantau perkembangan tanamanmu</p></div><button class="text-link" onclick={()=>go('Lahan Saya')}>Lihat semua <ArrowUpRight size={14}/></button></div><div class="field-preview"><img src={fields[0]?.image} alt="Lahan jagung"/><div class="field-summary"><div class="field-name-row"><h3>{fields[0]?.name||'Kebun Utama'}</h3><span class="status-chip"><i></i> Tumbuh baik</span></div><p>🌽 &nbsp;{fields[0]?.crop||'Jagung Manis'} <span>·</span> {fields[0]?.area||1000} m²</p><p><MapPin size={13}/>{fields[0]?.location||profile.location}</p><div class="progress-wrap"><div class="progress-copy"><span>Fase vegetatif · Hari ke-26</span><b>32%</b></div><div class="progress-track"><i style={`width:${fields[0]?.progress||32}%`}></i></div></div></div></div></article>
<article class="panel agenda-panel"><div class="panel-head"><div><h2>Agenda hari ini</h2><p>{new Date().toLocaleDateString('id-ID',{weekday:'long',day:'numeric',month:'long'})}</p></div><button class="text-link" onclick={()=>go('Kalender Tani')}>Kalender <ArrowUpRight size={14}/></button></div><div class="agenda-list">{#each (todayActivities.length?todayActivities:activities.slice(0,2)) as item}<div class="agenda-row"><div class="agenda-time">{item.time}</div><div class="agenda-ico">{item.kind==='Penyiraman'?'💧':'🌿'}</div><div class="agenda-title"><b>{item.title}</b><small>{item.field} · {item.kind}</small></div><button class:done={item.done} class="agenda-check" onclick={()=>toggleActivity(item)} title="Tandai selesai">{#if item.done}<Check size={14}/>{:else}<span></span>{/if}</button></div>{/each}</div><button class="add-agenda" onclick={openAddActivity}><Plus size={14}/> Tambah kegiatan</button></article>
<article class="panel consult-panel"><div class="panel-head"><div><h2>Penyuluh untukmu</h2><p>Ahli yang siap mendampingi</p></div><button class="text-link" onclick={()=>go('Temu Penyuluh')}>Cari penyuluh <ArrowUpRight size={14}/></button></div><div class="officer-row"><div class="officer-avatar">SR</div><div class="officer-info"><b>Siti Rahmawati, S.P.</b><small>Tanaman Pangan · Wilayah Bogor</small><span><i></i> Sedang online</span></div><button class="consult-btn" onclick={()=>modal='consult'}>Konsultasi</button></div></article><article class="notice-panel"><div class="notice-heading"><span><Sun size={17}/></span><div><b>Pengingat dari penyuluh</b><small>Perhatikan cuaca pekan ini</small></div></div><p>Hujan diperkirakan turun menjelang sore. Periksa drainase lahan agar air tidak menggenang.</p><small class="notice-source">Siti Rahmawati, S.P. · 08.15</small></article></div>
<article class="panel learning-preview"><div class="panel-head"><div><h2>Belajar dari kebun</h2><p>Tips singkat untuk musim tanam ini</p></div><button class="text-link" onclick={()=>go('Belajar Tani')}>Lihat artikel <ArrowUpRight size={14}/></button></div><div class="featured-article"><img src={articles[0].image} alt="Artikel budidaya"/><div><span class="article-category">{articles[0].category}</span><h3>{articles[0].title}</h3><small>{articles[0].read} membaca · Penyuluh Bogor</small></div><button class="article-open" onclick={()=>{current='Detail Artikel';selectedArticle=articles[0]}}><ArrowUpRight size={17}/></button></div></article>
{:else if current==='Lahan Saya'}
{#if selectedField}<div class="page-heading"><div><button class="back-link" onclick={()=>selectedField=null}><ArrowLeft size={15}/> Kembali ke lahan</button><h1>{selectedField.name}</h1><p>Detail komoditas dan perkembangan budidaya.</p></div><button class="btn btn-primary" onclick={openAddActivity}><Plus size={16}/> Tambah kegiatan</button></div><div class="detail-grid"><article class="panel detail-hero"><img src={selectedField.image} alt={selectedField.name}/><div><span class="status-chip"><i></i>{selectedField.status}</span><h2>{selectedField.crop}</h2><p><MapPin size={14}/>{selectedField.location}</p><div class="detail-facts"><span>Luas lahan<b>{selectedField.area} m²</b></span><span>Tanggal tanam<b>{selectedField.planted}</b></span><span>Perkiraan panen<b>{selectedField.harvest||'Belum ditentukan'}</b></span></div><div class="progress-wrap"><div class="progress-copy"><span>{selectedField.stage}</span><b>{selectedField.progress}%</b></div><div class="progress-track"><i style={`width:${selectedField.progress}%`}></i></div></div></div></article><article class="panel"><div class="panel-head"><div><h2>Catatan budidaya</h2><p>Jadwal yang berkaitan dengan lahan</p></div></div>{#each activities.filter(x=>x.field===selectedField.name) as item}<div class="agenda-row"><div class="agenda-time">{item.date?.slice(5)}</div><div class="agenda-ico">🌱</div><div class="agenda-title"><b>{item.title}</b><small>{item.kind} · {item.time}</small></div></div>{/each}</article></div>{:else}<div class="page-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">KEBUN & SAWAH</div><h1>Lahan saya</h1><p>Semua yang kamu tanam, tercatat dengan baik.</p></div><button class="btn btn-primary" onclick={openAddField}><Plus size={16}/> Tambah lahan</button></div><div class="toolbar"><label class="search-box"><Search size={16}/><input placeholder="Cari nama lahan atau komoditas" bind:value={searchText}/></label><span>{filteredFields.length} lahan terdaftar</span></div><div class="farms-grid">{#each filteredFields as field}<button class="farm-card" onclick={()=>selectedField=field}><img src={field.image} alt={field.name}/><div class="farm-body"><div class="farm-name"><h3>{field.name}</h3><ChevronRight size={17}/></div><span class="crop-label">🌱 &nbsp;{field.crop}</span><p><MapPin size={13}/>{field.location}</p><div class="farm-meta"><span><Tractor size={13}/> {field.area} m²</span><span><CalendarDays size={13}/> Tanam {field.planted}</span></div><div class="progress-wrap"><div class="progress-copy"><span>{field.stage||'Pertumbuhan'}</span><b>{field.progress||20}%</b></div><div class="progress-track"><i style={`width:${field.progress||20}%`}></i></div></div></div></button>{/each}<button class="farm-add" onclick={openAddField}><span><Plus size={20}/></span><b>Tambahkan lahan baru</b><small>Catat lahan dan komoditasmu</small></button></div>{/if}
{:else if current==='Kalender Tani'}
<div class="page-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">RENCANA BUDIDAYA</div><h1>Kalender Tani</h1><p>Jadwal sederhana agar kegiatan di lahan tidak terlewat.</p></div><button class="btn btn-primary" onclick={openAddActivity}><Plus size={16}/> Tambah kegiatan</button></div><div class="calendar-layout"><article class="panel calendar-panel"><div class="calendar-title"><button class="calendar-arrow" onclick={()=>notify('Bulan sebelumnya')}>‹</button><div><b>September 2026</b><small>Musim tanam jagung manis</small></div><button class="calendar-arrow" onclick={()=>notify('Bulan berikutnya')}>›</button></div><div class="calendar-grid">{#each ['Min','Sen','Sel','Rab','Kam','Jum','Sab'] as day}<div class="weekday">{day}</div>{/each}{#each Array(35) as _,i}<button class:muted-day={i<2||i>31} class:today={i===29} class:has-event={[5,12,19,27,29].includes(i)} onclick={()=>notify(`Kegiatan tanggal ${Math.max(1,i-1)} September`)}>{Math.max(1,i-1)}{#if [5,12,19,27,29].includes(i)}<i></i>{/if}</button>{/each}</div><div class="calendar-legend"><span><i class="legend-green"></i>Kegiatan lahan</span><span><i class="legend-gold"></i>Pengingat</span></div></article><article class="panel upcoming-panel"><div class="panel-head"><div><h2>Kegiatan mendatang</h2><p>Jadwal perawatan lahan</p></div><CalendarClock size={18}/></div>{#each activities as item}<div class="upcoming-row"><div class="upcoming-date"><b>{item.date?.slice(-2)}</b><small>SEP</small></div><div class="agenda-title"><b>{item.title}</b><small>{item.field} · {item.time}</small></div><button class:done={item.done} class="agenda-check" onclick={()=>toggleActivity(item)}>{#if item.done}<Check size={14}/>{:else}<span></span>{/if}</button></div>{/each}<button class="add-agenda" onclick={openAddActivity}><Plus size={14}/> Buat jadwal baru</button></article></div>
{:else if current==='Temu Penyuluh'}
<div class="page-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">BERTANYA LANGSUNG</div><h1>Temu Penyuluh</h1><p>Temukan pendamping yang memahami tanaman dan wilayahmu.</p></div><label class="search-box"><Search size={16}/><input placeholder="Cari nama atau keahlian" bind:value={searchText}/></label></div><div class="consult-layout"><div class="officer-directory">{#each [{name:'Siti Rahmawati, S.P.',area:'Bogor, Jawa Barat',spec:'Tanaman Pangan',crops:'Jagung · Padi · Kedelai',online:true,initial:'SR'},{name:'Dedi Kurniawan, S.P.',area:'Cibinong, Bogor',spec:'Hortikultura',crops:'Cabai · Tomat · Sayuran',online:true,initial:'DK'},{name:'Rina Puspitasari, S.P.',area:'Kabupaten Bogor',spec:'Perlindungan Tanaman',crops:'Hama · Penyakit · Cabai',online:false,initial:'RP'}].filter(o=>`${o.name} ${o.spec} ${o.crops}`.toLowerCase().includes(searchText.toLowerCase())) as officer}<article class="officer-card"><div class="officer-card-top"><div class="officer-avatar large">{officer.initial}</div><span class:offline={!officer.online} class="online-badge"><i></i>{officer.online?'Online':'Jadwal tersedia'}</span></div><h3>{officer.name}</h3><p>{officer.spec}</p><div class="officer-location"><MapPin size={14}/>{officer.area}</div><div class="expertise-chips"><span>{officer.crops.split(' · ')[0]}</span><span>{officer.crops.split(' · ')[1]}</span></div><button class="btn btn-primary full" onclick={()=>{selectedOfficer=officer;modal='consult'}}>Konsultasi <MessageCircle size={15}/></button></article>{/each}</div><article class="panel consult-aside"><span class="aside-illustration">🧑🏽‍🌾</span><h2>Lebih yakin dengan arahan yang tepat.</h2><p>Ceritakan kondisi tanamanmu, tambahkan foto bila perlu, lalu penyuluh akan membantu meninjau langkah selanjutnya.</p><div class="aside-feature"><Check size={15}/> Tanya sesuai komoditas dan wilayah</div><div class="aside-feature"><Check size={15}/> Riwayat konsultasi tersimpan</div><div class="aside-feature"><Check size={15}/> Foto tanaman bisa dilampirkan</div></article></div>
{:else if current==='Chat Konsultasi'}
<div class="page-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">KONSULTASI AKTIF</div><h1>Ruang konsultasi</h1><p>Riwayat percakapanmu dengan penyuluh.</p></div><button class="btn btn-outline dark-outline" onclick={()=>go('Temu Penyuluh')}><ArrowLeft size={15}/> Kembali ke penyuluh</button></div><div class="chat-layout"><aside class="panel chat-list"><div class="panel-head"><div><h2>Pesan</h2><p>{consultations.length} percakapan</p></div><button class="icon-circle" onclick={()=>go('Temu Penyuluh')}><Plus size={17}/></button></div>{#each consultations as c}<button class="chat-contact" class:selected={selectedConsultation?.id===c.id} onclick={()=>selectedConsultation=c}><div class="officer-avatar">SR</div><div><b>{c.name}</b><small>{c.last}</small></div><span>{c.time}</span></button>{/each}</aside><section class="panel chat-window"><header class="chat-header"><div class="officer-avatar">SR</div><div><b>{consultations[0]?.name||'Siti Rahmawati, S.P.'}</b><small><i></i> Penyuluh · Online</small></div><button class="icon-circle" onclick={()=>notify('Profil penyuluh terverifikasi')}><Eye size={17}/></button></header><div class="chat-topic"><span>TOPIK KONSULTASI</span><b>Daun jagung mulai menguning</b></div><div class="chat-messages">{#each messages as message}<div class:mine={message.from==='me'} class="chat-message-row"><div class="message-avatar">{message.from==='me'?'BS':'SR'}</div><div class="chat-message"><p>{message.text}</p><small>{message.time}</small></div></div>{/each}</div><div class="chat-compose"><label class="attach-button" title="Lampirkan foto"><ImagePlus size={19}/><input type="file" accept="image/*" onchange={uploadChatImage}/></label><input placeholder="Tulis pesan..." bind:value={chatText} onkeydown={(e)=>e.key==='Enter'&&sendMessage()}/><button onclick={sendMessage}><Send size={17}/></button></div></section></div>
{:else if current==='Belajar Tani'}
<div class="page-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">PENGETAHUAN BUDIDAYA</div><h1>Belajar Tani</h1><p>Wawasan praktis dari penyuluh untuk mendampingi musim tanammu.</p></div><label class="search-box"><Search size={16}/><input placeholder="Cari topik belajar" bind:value={searchText}/></label></div><div class="category-row"><button class="category active" onclick={()=>searchText=''}>Semua topik</button><button class="category" onclick={()=>searchText='Jagung'}>Jagung</button><button class="category" onclick={()=>searchText='Hama'}>Hama & penyakit</button><button class="category" onclick={()=>searchText='Perencanaan'}>Perencanaan</button></div><div class="article-grid">{#each articles.filter(a=>`${a.title} ${a.category}`.toLowerCase().includes(searchText.toLowerCase())) as article}<article class="article-card"><img src={article.image} alt={article.title}/><div class="article-card-body"><span class="article-category">{article.category}</span><h3>{article.title}</h3><p>{article.text}</p><div class="article-card-footer"><small><Clock3 size={13}/>{article.read} membaca</small><button onclick={()=>{selectedArticle=article;current='Detail Artikel'}} aria-label="Baca artikel"><ArrowUpRight size={16}/></button></div></div></article>{/each}</div>
{:else if current==='Detail Artikel'}
{@const article=selectedArticle||articles[0]}<button class="back-link" onclick={()=>go('Belajar Tani')}><ArrowLeft size={15}/> Kembali ke artikel</button><article class="article-detail"><img src={article.image} alt={article.title}/><div class="article-detail-body"><span class="article-category">{article.category}</span><h1>{article.title}</h1><p class="article-byline">Materi penyuluh · {article.read} membaca</p><p>{article.text}</p><p>Setiap lahan memiliki kondisi yang berbeda. Gunakan panduan ini sebagai informasi awal dan konsultasikan kepada penyuluh bila kondisi tanaman tidak membaik.</p><button class="btn btn-primary" onclick={()=>go('Temu Penyuluh')}>Tanyakan ke penyuluh <MessageCircle size={15}/></button></div></article>
{:else if current==='Hama & Penyakit'}
<div class="page-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">KENALI LEBIH AWAL</div><h1>Hama & Penyakit</h1><p>Informasi awal untuk membantumu mengamati kondisi tanaman.</p></div><button class="btn btn-primary" onclick={()=>modal='consult'}><MessageCircle size={15}/> Tanya penyuluh</button></div><div class="notice-callout"><AlertTriangle size={20}/><p><b>Informasi ini bukan diagnosis.</b> Gejala tanaman dapat memiliki beberapa penyebab. Gunakan sebagai panduan pengamatan dan konfirmasi kepada penyuluh.</p></div><div class="pest-grid">{#each pests as pest}<article class="panel pest-card"><div class="pest-card-top"><span class="pest-icon"><Bug size={19}/></span><span class={`risk ${pest.color}`}>{pest.level} · {pest.risk}</span></div><h3>{pest.name}</h3><span class="crop-label">Komoditas: {pest.crop}</span><p>{pest.desc}</p><button class="text-link" onclick={()=>modal='consult'}>Diskusikan dengan penyuluh <ChevronRight size={14}/></button></article>{/each}</div>
{:else if current==='Notifikasi'}
<div class="page-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">INFO TERBARU</div><h1>Notifikasi</h1><p>Pengingat lahan dan kabar konsultasimu.</p></div><button class="btn btn-outline dark-outline" onclick={()=>{notifications=notifications.map(n=>({...n,unread:false}));notify('Semua notifikasi sudah dibaca.')}}><Check size={15}/> Tandai semua dibaca</button></div><div class="panel notification-list">{#each notifications as n}<button class:unread={n.unread} class="notification-item" onclick={()=>{n.unread=false;go(n.title.includes('Pesan')?'Chat Konsultasi':'Kalender Tani')}}><span class="notification-icon">{n.title.includes('Cuaca')?'☀️':n.title.includes('Pesan')?'💬':'💧'}</span><span class="notification-copy"><b>{n.title}</b><small>{n.body}</small></span><span class="notification-time">{n.time}</span>{#if n.unread}<i class="notification-unread"></i>{/if}</button>{/each}</div>
{:else if current==='Profil Saya'}
<div class="page-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">AKUN & PREFERENSI</div><h1>Profil saya</h1><p>Kelola informasi yang membantu penyuluh dan sistem mengenal lahanmu.</p></div></div><div class="profile-layout"><article class="panel profile-card"><div class="profile-cover"></div><div class="profile-details"><div class="avatar profile-big">{profile.name.split(' ').map(x=>x[0]).slice(0,2).join('')}</div><h2>{profile.name}</h2><p>{role} · {profile.location}</p><span class="profile-verified"><ShieldCheck size={14}/> Akun aktif</span><hr/><div class="profile-field"><span>Email</span><b>{profile.email}</b></div><div class="profile-field"><span>Lokasi utama</span><b>{profile.location}</b></div><div class="profile-field"><span>Komoditas utama</span><b>Jagung Manis</b></div><button class="btn btn-outline dark-outline full" onclick={()=>notify('Edit profil segera tersedia.')}><Settings size={15}/> Edit profil</button></div></article><article class="panel preference-card"><h2>Preferensi lahan</h2><p>Informasi dasar untuk rekomendasi budidaya.</p><label>Komoditas utama<select><option>Jagung Manis</option><option>Padi</option><option>Cabai Merah</option><option>Kedelai</option></select></label><label>Wilayah<select><option>Cibinong, Bogor, Jawa Barat</option><option>Kabupaten Bogor, Jawa Barat</option></select></label><button class="btn btn-primary" onclick={()=>notify('Preferensi tersimpan.')}>Simpan perubahan</button>{#if profile.requestedRole==='officer'&&role==='Petani'}<div class="pending-review"><ShieldCheck size={16}/><span><b>Permintaan akun penyuluh tercatat</b><small>Admin perlu memverifikasi profilmu sebelum fitur penyuluh aktif.</small></span></div>{/if}<hr/><button class="logout-button" onclick={signOut}><LogOut size={16}/> Keluar dari akun</button></article></div>
{:else if current==='Dashboard Penyuluh' || current==='Permintaan Konsultasi' || current==='Petani Binaan' || current==='Jadwal Kunjungan' || current==='Materi Edukasi'}
<div class="page-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">RUANG KERJA PENYULUH</div><h1>{current==='Dashboard Penyuluh'?'Selamat datang, Bu Siti':current}</h1><p>Pantau konsultasi dan dampingi petani binaanmu.</p></div><button class="btn btn-primary" onclick={()=>go('Permintaan Konsultasi')}><MessageCircle size={15}/> Lihat konsultasi</button></div><div class="officer-stats"><article class="panel"><span>Permintaan baru</span><b>4</b><small>Perlu ditinjau</small></article><article class="panel"><span>Konsultasi aktif</span><b>8</b><small>Petani sedang didampingi</small></article><article class="panel"><span>Petani binaan</span><b>42</b><small>Wilayah Bogor</small></article></div><div class="dashboard-grid officer-work"><article class="panel"><div class="panel-head"><div><h2>Permintaan konsultasi</h2><p>Petani menunggu arahan</p></div><button class="text-link" onclick={()=>notify('Semua permintaan ditampilkan')}>Lihat semua <ArrowUpRight size={14}/></button></div>{#each [{n:'Budi Santoso',crop:'Jagung manis · Daun menguning',time:'8 menit lalu'},{n:'Rina Amelia',crop:'Cabai · Bercak pada daun',time:'35 menit lalu'},{n:'Agus Setiawan',crop:'Padi · Pertumbuhan lambat',time:'1 jam lalu'}] as req}<div class="request-row"><div class="avatar">{req.n.split(' ').map(x=>x[0]).slice(0,2).join('')}</div><div><b>{req.n}</b><small>{req.crop}</small><small>{req.time}</small></div><button class="consult-btn" onclick={()=>{current='Chat Konsultasi';notify('Ruang konsultasi dibuka')}}>Tinjau</button></div>{/each}</article><article class="panel"><div class="panel-head"><div><h2>Agenda kunjungan</h2><p>Jadwal lapangan pekan ini</p></div><CalendarDays size={18}/></div><div class="visit-card"><span>28 SEP</span><div><b>Kunjungan lahan · Budi Santoso</b><small>Cibinong · Jagung manis · 09.00</small></div></div><div class="visit-card"><span>30 SEP</span><div><b>Pendampingan kelompok tani</b><small>Kelurahan Tengah · 08.30</small></div></div><button class="add-agenda" onclick={()=>go('Jadwal Kunjungan')}><Plus size={14}/> Atur jadwal kunjungan</button></article></div><article class="panel verification"><ShieldCheck size={20}/><div><b>Status akun penyuluh</b><small>Akun demo terverifikasi · Profil ditampilkan kepada petani di Bogor.</small></div><span>TERVERIFIKASI</span></article>
{:else if current==='Dashboard Admin' || current==='Data Pengguna' || current==='Verifikasi Penyuluh' || current==='Kelola Artikel' || current==='Laporan & Hama'}
<div class="page-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">PENGELOLAAN PLATFORM</div><h1>{current==='Dashboard Admin'?'Ringkasan admin':current}</h1><p>Kelola pengguna dan konten Temu Penyuluh.</p></div><span class="admin-badge"><ShieldCheck size={15}/> Mode admin</span></div><div class="officer-stats"><article class="panel"><span>Petani terdaftar</span><b>1.248</b><small>↑ 12% bulan ini</small></article><article class="panel"><span>Penyuluh aktif</span><b>86</b><small>7 menunggu verifikasi</small></article><article class="panel"><span>Konsultasi bulan ini</span><b>394</b><small>91% selesai ditangani</small></article></div><article class="panel admin-table"><div class="panel-head"><div><h2>Verifikasi penyuluh</h2><p>Pastikan profil profesional sebelum menerima konsultasi</p></div><button class="text-link" onclick={()=>current='Verifikasi Penyuluh'}>Tinjau semua <ArrowUpRight size={14}/></button></div>{#each [{name:'Maya Kusuma, S.P.',region:'Sukabumi, Jawa Barat',expertise:'Hortikultura'},{name:'Taufik Hidayat, S.P.',region:'Cianjur, Jawa Barat',expertise:'Tanaman Pangan'},{name:'Lina Setiawati, S.P.',region:'Garut, Jawa Barat',expertise:'Perlindungan Tanaman'}] as req}<div class="request-row"><div class="officer-avatar">{req.name.split(' ').map(x=>x[0]).slice(0,2).join('')}</div><div><b>{req.name}</b><small>{req.region} · {req.expertise}</small></div><button class="consult-btn" onclick={()=>notify(`Profil ${req.name} diverifikasi`)}>Verifikasi</button></div>{/each}</article><div class="notice-callout"><ShieldCheck size={19}/><p>Role admin dalam produksi harus diberikan manual oleh pemilik database melalui Supabase. Pemilih role demo hanya untuk melihat contoh tampilan.</p></div>
{:else}
<div class="page-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">TEMU PENYULUH</div><h1>{current}</h1><p>Informasi budidaya dan pengelolaan lahan tersedia di menu utama.</p></div><button class="btn btn-primary" onclick={()=>go('Beranda')}>Kembali ke beranda</button></div>
{/if}
</div><footer class="app-footer"><span>© 2026 Temu Penyuluh</span><span>Teman Digital Petani, dari Tanam hingga Panen.</span><button onclick={()=>modal='help'}><CircleHelp size={14}/> Bantuan</button></footer></main></div><nav class="bottom-nav">{#each nav.slice(0,5) as item}<button class:active={current===item.name} onclick={()=>go(item.name)}><svelte:component this={item.icon} size={19}/><small>{item.name==='Lahan Saya'?'Lahan':item.name==='Kalender Tani'?'Kalender':item.name==='Temu Penyuluh'?'Penyuluh':item.name==='Belajar Tani'?'Belajar':'Beranda'}</small></button>{/each}</nav>
{/if}

{#if modal}<div class="modal-backdrop" role="presentation" onclick={(e)=>e.target===e.currentTarget&&(modal='')}><section class="modal-card" role="dialog" aria-modal="true">{#if modal==='login'}<button class="modal-close" onclick={()=>modal=''}><X size={18}/></button><div class="modal-brand"><span class="brand-icon"><Sprout size={21}/></span></div><h2>Selamat datang di<br/>Temu Penyuluh</h2><p>Masuk untuk mengelola lahan dan terhubung dengan penyuluh.</p><label class="role-label">Masuk sebagai</label><div class="role-choices"><button class:chosen={loginRole==='petani'} onclick={()=>loginRole='petani'}>👩🏽‍🌾 Petani</button><button class:chosen={loginRole==='penyuluh'} onclick={()=>loginRole='penyuluh'}>🧑🏽‍🌾 Penyuluh</button></div><button class="google-button" onclick={signInGoogle}>{@render GoogleMark()} Lanjutkan dengan Google</button><div class="or-divider"><span>atau masuk dengan email</span></div><label class="email-field"><span>Alamat email</span><input type="email" placeholder="nama@email.com" bind:value={loginEmail}/></label><button class="btn btn-primary full" onclick={signInEmail}>Kirim tautan masuk <ArrowUpRight size={15}/></button><small class="auth-terms">Dengan masuk, kamu menyetujui ketentuan penggunaan dan kebijakan privasi.</small><div class="demo-divider"><span>COBA PROTOTIPE</span></div><div class="demo-roles"><button onclick={()=>setDemo('Petani')}>Lihat sebagai petani</button><button onclick={()=>setDemo('Penyuluh')}>Lihat sebagai penyuluh</button><button onclick={()=>setDemo('Admin')}>Lihat sebagai admin</button></div>{#if !configured}<small class="config-note">Login asli aktif setelah URL dan publishable key Supabase ditambahkan.</small>{/if}
{:else if modal==='role'}<button class="modal-close" onclick={()=>modal=''}><X size={18}/></button><h2>Pilih tampilan demo</h2><p>Mode ini hanya untuk pratinjau. Hak akses produksi ditentukan melalui Supabase.</p><div class="demo-roles vertical"><button onclick={()=>setDemo('Petani')}>👩🏽‍🌾 Masuk sebagai petani</button><button onclick={()=>setDemo('Penyuluh')}>🧑🏽‍🌾 Masuk sebagai penyuluh</button><button onclick={()=>setDemo('Admin')}>🛡️ Masuk sebagai admin</button></div>{#if loggedIn}<button class="logout-button" onclick={signOut}><LogOut size={16}/> Keluar dari akun</button>{/if}
{:else if modal==='field'}<button class="modal-close" onclick={()=>modal=''}><X size={18}/></button><h2>Tambahkan lahan</h2><p>Catat lahan baru agar perkembangan dan kegiatannya mudah dipantau.</p><label class="form-label">Nama lahan<input bind:value={fieldForm.name} placeholder="Contoh: Kebun Jagung Utara"/></label><div class="form-two"><label class="form-label">Komoditas<select bind:value={fieldForm.crop}><option>Jagung Manis</option><option>Padi</option><option>Cabai Merah</option><option>Kedelai</option><option>Tomat</option><option>Lainnya</option></select></label><label class="form-label">Luas (m²)<input type="number" min="1" bind:value={fieldForm.area} placeholder="1000"/></label></div><label class="form-label">Lokasi<input bind:value={fieldForm.location} placeholder="Desa, kecamatan, kabupaten"/></label><label class="form-label">Tanggal tanam<input type="date" bind:value={fieldForm.planted}/></label><label class="form-label">Foto lahan <span class="optional">· opsional</span><span class="upload-field"><CloudUpload size={17}/> Pilih foto (maks. 5 MB)<input type="file" accept="image/*" onchange={(e)=>uploadFile=e.currentTarget.files?.[0]}/></span></label><div class="modal-actions"><button class="btn btn-outline dark-outline" onclick={()=>modal=''}>Batal</button><button class="btn btn-primary" onclick={saveField}>Simpan lahan <Check size={15}/></button></div>
{:else if modal==='activity'}<button class="modal-close" onclick={()=>modal=''}><X size={18}/></button><h2>Tambah kegiatan</h2><p>Jadwalkan perawatan, pemantauan, atau kegiatan budidaya lainnya.</p><label class="form-label">Nama kegiatan<input bind:value={activityForm.title} placeholder="Contoh: Penyiraman pagi"/></label><div class="form-two"><label class="form-label">Jenis kegiatan<select bind:value={activityForm.kind}><option>Penyiraman</option><option>Pemupukan</option><option>Penyemprotan</option><option>Penyiangan</option><option>Pengendalian hama</option><option>Pemangkasan</option><option>Panen</option><option>Pemantauan</option><option>Lainnya</option></select></label><label class="form-label">Lahan<select bind:value={activityForm.field}>{#each fields as f}<option>{f.name}</option>{/each}</select></label></div><div class="form-two"><label class="form-label">Tanggal<input type="date" bind:value={activityForm.date}/></label><label class="form-label">Waktu<input type="time" bind:value={activityForm.time}/></label></div><div class="modal-actions"><button class="btn btn-outline dark-outline" onclick={()=>modal=''}>Batal</button><button class="btn btn-primary" onclick={saveActivity}>Simpan jadwal <Check size={15}/></button></div>
{:else if modal==='consult'}<button class="modal-close" onclick={()=>modal=''}><X size={18}/></button><div class="consult-modal-icon"><MessageCircle size={20}/></div><h2>Mulai konsultasi</h2><p>Ceritakan kondisi tanamanmu. Penyuluh akan membantu menentukan langkah yang perlu diperiksa.</p>{#if selectedOfficer}<div class="selected-officer"><div class="officer-avatar">{selectedOfficer.initial}</div><div><b>{selectedOfficer.name}</b><small>{selectedOfficer.spec} · {selectedOfficer.area}</small></div></div>{/if}<label class="form-label">Topik konsultasi<select><option>Masalah tanaman</option><option>Daun menguning</option><option>Hama atau penyakit</option><option>Pemupukan</option><option>Jadwal tanam</option><option>Lainnya</option></select></label><label class="form-label">Ceritakan kondisi tanaman<textarea rows="3" placeholder="Contoh: daun jagung mulai menguning sejak kemarin..." bind:value={consultText}></textarea></label><div class="modal-actions"><button class="btn btn-outline dark-outline" onclick={()=>modal=''}>Batal</button><button class="btn btn-primary" onclick={startConsultation}>Kirim permintaan <Send size={15}/></button></div>
{:else if modal==='help'}<button class="modal-close" onclick={()=>modal=''}><X size={18}/></button><h2>Pusat bantuan</h2><p>Untuk pertanyaan seputar akun, lahan, atau penggunaan Temu Penyuluh, hubungi tim pendamping.</p><div class="help-contact"><MessageCircle size={17}/><span><b>Tim Temu Penyuluh</b><small>Senin–Jumat · 08.00–16.00 WIB</small></span></div><button class="btn btn-primary full" onclick={()=>{modal='consult';current='Temu Penyuluh'}}>Hubungi penyuluh <ArrowUpRight size={15}/></button>{/if}</section></div>{/if}
{#if toast}<div class="toast"><Check size={15}/>{toast}</div>{/if}

